Cross-building FreeBSD is ridiculously easy these days:

$ cd /usr/src
$ make buildworld TARGET_ARCH=alpha
$ su
Password:
# mkdir /tmp/alpha
# make installworld TARGET_ARCH=alpha DESTDIR=/tmp/alpha

so you don't need an Alpha to test the Alpha build.

